WEBVTT

00:20.840 --> 00:23.120
BEAUTY

00:23.920 --> 00:25.840
Good morning, students.

00:26.360 --> 00:27.560
Soon,

00:27.640 --> 00:31.680
the winner of the school's
annual Shining Star award

00:31.760 --> 00:34.040
will be officially announced.

00:34.520 --> 00:39.440
The winner will receive an honorary trophy
as well as a special prize.

00:39.520 --> 00:41.960
There will also be many other privileges

00:42.040 --> 00:46.360
for the Shining Star
and all of our top ten stars.

00:46.760 --> 00:47.720
That's right.

00:48.280 --> 00:50.280
Just like the director said,

00:50.360 --> 00:52.880
beauty is everything to a woman.

00:53.240 --> 00:55.120
There are no ugly people,

00:55.200 --> 00:56.880
only lazy ones.

00:57.600 --> 00:58.720
How about you?

00:58.800 --> 01:01.400
Are you ready to achieve your full beauty?

02:32.480 --> 02:34.640
Good morning, girls.

02:34.720 --> 02:37.880
Today, the rankings haven't changed.

02:37.960 --> 02:39.160
But don't forget,

02:39.240 --> 02:40.720
as long as you don't give up,

02:40.800 --> 02:43.000
you will always be prettier tomorrow.

02:45.760 --> 02:48.560
GODDESS OF BEAUTY

02:50.080 --> 02:51.320
Excuse me.

02:52.160 --> 02:54.560
Hello. Come in.

02:57.560 --> 02:59.320
Introduce yourself to your classmates.

03:00.320 --> 03:01.240
Hello.

03:01.880 --> 03:03.160
I'm Nanno.

03:04.320 --> 03:05.560
Nice to meet you.

03:06.920 --> 03:08.160
Princess Ten.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.320
Yes, ma'am.

03:10.400 --> 03:12.320
Nanno is joining us
in the middle of the semester.

03:12.400 --> 03:13.440
She might be behind.

03:13.520 --> 03:15.800
As the class leader,
I would like you to look after her.

03:15.880 --> 03:17.240
Yes, ma'am.

03:17.840 --> 03:19.680
Take the seat next to Ying.

03:19.760 --> 03:20.600
Okay.

03:23.280 --> 03:25.480
When a girl smiles to a new acquaintance,

03:25.720 --> 03:27.200
it means one of two things.

03:28.520 --> 03:29.400
One,

03:29.480 --> 03:30.800
she wants to be friends.

03:30.880 --> 03:32.160
Two,

03:32.240 --> 03:34.040
she wants to make friends with an enemy.

03:35.440 --> 03:37.680
Everyone, get your textbooks out.

03:37.920 --> 03:40.040
It will always be the latter

03:40.120 --> 03:42.560
if the other girl is prettier.

03:45.360 --> 03:46.360
Hey,

03:46.840 --> 03:48.680
what happened to your face?

03:49.960 --> 03:52.760
Oh, I cut it on a leaf. It's nothing.

03:52.840 --> 03:54.440
It's not nothing.

03:54.960 --> 03:56.120
Around here,

03:56.200 --> 03:57.800
you must take good care of yourself.

03:58.560 --> 04:00.920
You can't go around looking disfigured.

04:01.000 --> 04:03.080
She's not speaking her mind.

04:03.160 --> 04:04.880
This is getting interesting.

04:04.960 --> 04:05.800
Okay.

04:14.320 --> 04:16.720
LERD FAH TOWER

04:18.800 --> 04:20.720
"Lerd Fah Tower."

04:21.959 --> 04:24.200
We call it "Top Ten Tower."

04:25.880 --> 04:27.120
Top ten?

04:29.680 --> 04:30.680
Hang on.

04:31.120 --> 04:33.800
Are you that out of the loop?

04:37.200 --> 04:41.080
Here, we rank the top ten
most beautiful students.

04:41.440 --> 04:43.200
If anything happens to their faces,

04:43.280 --> 04:45.920
their ranking will be updated
in real time.

04:47.040 --> 04:48.920
We have an application

04:49.000 --> 04:51.200
that tells us our current ranking.

04:52.040 --> 04:54.800
This building is a privilege

04:54.880 --> 04:57.000
that the top ten models have earned,

04:57.080 --> 04:59.880
since they are the ones who spread
our school's beauty to the world.

05:01.720 --> 05:03.480
Where are you in the ranking?

05:07.040 --> 05:08.440
I'm lucky.

05:08.520 --> 05:10.040
I'm at number ten,

05:11.280 --> 05:12.600
even though

05:12.680 --> 05:14.840
there are many girls
who are prettier than me here.

05:16.080 --> 05:17.480
No wonder.

05:17.560 --> 05:19.200
That's why everyone calls you
Princess Ten.

05:21.240 --> 05:22.600
Do you want to come in?

05:24.400 --> 05:25.800
Well...

05:26.400 --> 05:28.200
Didn't you just say

05:28.600 --> 05:29.640
that this building

05:30.520 --> 05:32.440
is only for the top ten girls?

05:34.760 --> 05:35.720
Yes,

05:36.040 --> 05:38.360
but the top ten girls

05:38.800 --> 05:41.720
can bring one friend in as a guest.

05:42.120 --> 05:44.600
Do you want to see what it's like

05:44.960 --> 05:47.760
to live as one of the top ten?

05:48.800 --> 05:49.960
I do.

05:51.200 --> 05:52.960
How is it? Is it beautiful?

05:54.600 --> 05:56.120
This is the dining room.

05:56.600 --> 05:58.920
Over there is the living room.

05:59.000 --> 06:00.880
Hello, students.

06:01.360 --> 06:05.520
I'm sending all my support
to every student out there.

06:05.840 --> 06:09.520
Please do your best

06:09.600 --> 06:13.640
to become the next Shining Star.

06:14.280 --> 06:15.320
The winner

06:15.400 --> 06:19.080
will receive an honorary trophy
as well as a special prize.

06:19.160 --> 06:21.600
There will also be many other privileges

06:21.680 --> 06:26.040
for the Shining Star
and all the top ten stars.

06:26.600 --> 06:28.200
Don't forget

06:28.280 --> 06:29.960
that beauty is a woman's life,

06:30.520 --> 06:34.120
her faith, and her value.

06:35.040 --> 06:39.360
Let us thank our beauty
for showing us the way.

06:40.080 --> 06:42.200
And to every student,

06:42.720 --> 06:44.920
believe in your beauty.

06:45.760 --> 06:47.640
Good luck.

06:51.240 --> 06:52.760
Come on. Let's eat.

06:53.640 --> 06:54.520
This way.

07:01.680 --> 07:02.800
Is it good?

07:03.840 --> 07:05.120
Yes.

07:05.200 --> 07:06.760
Thank you so much, Ying.

07:07.760 --> 07:09.040
You're welcome.

07:09.120 --> 07:12.040
It's not like I paid for your meal.

07:12.800 --> 07:14.800
Yes, but you brought me in here.

07:16.480 --> 07:17.960
Don't worry about it.

07:19.680 --> 07:21.040
However...

07:23.760 --> 07:26.200
I might not be able
to bring you here often.

07:26.280 --> 07:28.200
100% HONEST

07:29.560 --> 07:30.720
On other days,

07:30.800 --> 07:34.040
you might need to live
as an ordinary person,

07:34.120 --> 07:36.080
with the average people.

07:37.640 --> 07:38.720
80% HONEST

07:39.800 --> 07:42.800
But it's not that bad.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.200
70% HONEST

07:45.960 --> 07:49.720
Sometimes, I think I would like
to live outside, too.

07:51.200 --> 07:52.120
50% HONEST

07:54.920 --> 07:56.720
You are so down to earth.

08:19.520 --> 08:20.520
Nanno.

08:21.080 --> 08:23.560
Chocolate contains trans fat.

08:38.360 --> 08:39.840
I'll have one bite.

08:41.159 --> 08:42.720
I don't want to turn you down.

09:00.760 --> 09:02.480
Hello, Princess.

09:03.120 --> 09:04.560
Hello, Chompoo.

09:05.360 --> 09:06.960
Who did you come in with today?

09:07.480 --> 09:08.600
I...

09:09.960 --> 09:10.920
Well...

09:13.040 --> 09:14.520
Chompoo,

09:14.600 --> 09:16.400
you can't just wander in here

09:17.240 --> 09:19.160
without a top ten.

09:26.040 --> 09:27.160
Do you want it?

09:29.320 --> 09:31.160
Here. Take it.

09:31.240 --> 09:32.760
I can't eat it all.

09:33.240 --> 09:34.440
I don't want to put on weight.

09:36.920 --> 09:37.960
Really?

09:41.040 --> 09:42.600
Thank you.

09:42.680 --> 09:44.200
You can't be in here.

09:52.480 --> 09:54.280
I feel so bad for Chompoo.

09:55.640 --> 09:57.680
With that flat face and nose of hers,

09:57.960 --> 09:59.920
she'll never get to live in here.

10:01.720 --> 10:02.720
50% HONEST

10:02.800 --> 10:04.600
Sometimes I pity her,

10:05.560 --> 10:07.240
so I bring her in with me

10:07.600 --> 10:08.680
or if I can't,

10:09.200 --> 10:10.520
I give her good food.

10:10.600 --> 10:11.440
10% HONEST

10:14.160 --> 10:15.480
You're not only pretty,

10:15.560 --> 10:17.400
but you're thoughtful, too.

10:18.040 --> 10:20.040
You deserve to be the Shining Star.

10:22.280 --> 10:23.400
No.

10:24.000 --> 10:25.360
I just want

10:25.440 --> 10:27.440
to help others when I can.

10:27.520 --> 10:30.240
0% HONEST

10:33.520 --> 10:34.680
I think she's here.

10:35.440 --> 10:36.360
What?

10:36.840 --> 10:38.000
The queen.

10:38.880 --> 10:40.200
The queen?

10:40.680 --> 10:41.720
Let's go.

10:41.800 --> 10:44.280
I'll show you the real Shining Star.

10:52.680 --> 10:53.960
That's Gade.

10:54.040 --> 10:55.640
She's in first place.

10:55.720 --> 10:58.680
NUMBER 1, GADE PIMNAPA

10:59.240 --> 11:00.520
Those twins,

11:00.600 --> 11:02.160
they are Cherry and Lilly.

11:02.240 --> 11:04.720
They are in second and third place.

11:05.280 --> 11:07.920
And those two are Kim and Fah.

11:08.000 --> 11:10.040
They are fifth and seventh.

11:12.520 --> 11:14.640
Gade is beautiful,

11:15.360 --> 11:16.920
smart,

11:17.000 --> 11:18.320
and friendly.

11:18.680 --> 11:19.920
Look at her.

11:20.000 --> 11:22.040
She walks like a swan.

11:22.720 --> 11:25.400
Wouldn't you like to be number one?

11:28.760 --> 11:30.000
I think

11:30.520 --> 11:32.440
you're just as beautiful as Gade.

11:41.720 --> 11:43.080
Are you insane?

11:44.240 --> 11:45.480
For me,

11:46.440 --> 11:47.960
just being in the top ten

11:48.040 --> 11:49.720
is more than I could hope for.

11:50.760 --> 11:52.920
As for becoming the Shining Star,

11:53.720 --> 11:55.480
I have never even thought about it.

11:56.800 --> 11:58.480
It's also impossible.

11:59.240 --> 12:01.080
No one can take Gade down.

12:04.120 --> 12:06.240
Ying.

12:09.080 --> 12:10.560
You don't know that.

12:14.360 --> 12:15.360
Nanno.

12:15.920 --> 12:17.160
Actually,

12:17.240 --> 12:18.720
you're quite pretty yourself.

12:19.920 --> 12:22.360
Why don't you check your own rank?

12:22.440 --> 12:24.720
What, me?

12:25.160 --> 12:26.800
I would be happy

12:26.880 --> 12:28.040
if I'm second to last.

12:28.120 --> 12:30.520
No way. Let's have a look.

12:30.600 --> 12:31.440
Come on.

12:31.520 --> 12:32.760
I'll check it for you.

12:41.800 --> 12:43.320
MARA AMARATAYAKUL

12:43.400 --> 12:44.400
What?

12:44.840 --> 12:46.360
I can't believe it.

12:46.880 --> 12:48.320
I'm in 11th place.

12:48.840 --> 12:50.840
I'm only one place behind you,

12:51.760 --> 12:53.680
even though you are
so much prettier than me.

12:58.680 --> 13:00.200
Congratulations, Nanno.

13:01.320 --> 13:02.160
Thank you.

13:06.520 --> 13:08.800
So, I have to go.

13:08.880 --> 13:10.280
Thank you, Ying.

13:34.480 --> 13:36.360
We are sorry to inform you

13:36.440 --> 13:40.960
that you have dropped to number 11.

13:42.920 --> 13:44.080
Oh, no.

14:10.440 --> 14:12.600
Congratulations, Nanno.

14:13.360 --> 14:15.360
You just started here,
but you're already number ten.

14:16.960 --> 14:19.720
You might even move up faster than Ying.

14:19.800 --> 14:21.600
Ying has been in tenth place for so long.

14:21.680 --> 14:23.240
She hasn't moved up at all.

14:29.600 --> 14:31.600
What? It's true, isn't it?

14:31.680 --> 14:32.560
Look.

14:41.080 --> 14:42.600
Hello,

14:42.680 --> 14:43.760
Princess Ten.

14:47.920 --> 14:49.240
You

14:49.800 --> 14:50.880
are number ten now.

14:51.600 --> 14:52.640
Come on now.

14:52.720 --> 14:55.440
You are still

14:55.520 --> 14:56.800
Princess 11.

14:58.200 --> 14:59.920
I'm sure it's only temporary.

15:00.320 --> 15:02.120
Once your pimple disappears,

15:02.200 --> 15:04.040
your ranking will go back to normal.

15:05.840 --> 15:06.960
Can I ask

15:07.440 --> 15:09.080
why you let yourself get a pimple?

15:09.640 --> 15:11.360
I've never seen you with a pimple before.

15:14.960 --> 15:15.960
Don't touch it.

15:16.400 --> 15:17.920
It will get worse if you touch it.

15:18.320 --> 15:22.120
You must have been eating sweets.
They can give you pimples.

15:31.160 --> 15:33.000
You can't leave it like that.

15:33.080 --> 15:36.200
I know a good clinic.
Shall I take you there?

15:38.120 --> 15:39.400
If the doctor is so good,

15:39.480 --> 15:41.280
why don't you let him
take a look at your face?

15:41.920 --> 15:43.400
It would be good.

15:46.120 --> 15:48.960
Do you want to go? I'm free this evening.

15:50.880 --> 15:52.080
It's fine.

15:52.560 --> 15:53.680
Thank you though.

15:56.320 --> 15:59.560
Well then, I'll get going.

16:00.760 --> 16:01.720
Let's go.

16:06.240 --> 16:07.120
Let's go.

16:11.240 --> 16:14.040
This bow is so tight, isn't it?

16:24.560 --> 16:26.440
And to every student,

16:26.920 --> 16:28.960
believe in your beauty.

16:29.840 --> 16:31.240
Good luck.

16:33.800 --> 16:37.040
Your name is not in the top ten.
Who did you come with?

16:37.520 --> 16:39.160
She's here with me.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.720
Come and sit down.

16:47.480 --> 16:48.640
No, it's fine.

16:49.360 --> 16:51.880
I accidentally came here out of habit.

16:53.360 --> 16:56.960
Actually, I kind of miss the food
in the canteen out there.

16:58.520 --> 17:00.080
I'll just eat there.

17:00.840 --> 17:03.800
You can have my quota, too, if you like.

17:04.839 --> 17:06.720
Then, tomorrow,

17:07.240 --> 17:08.839
come and eat here with me.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.200
It's so lonely

17:11.760 --> 17:13.240
sitting here all alone.

17:15.640 --> 17:16.599
Okay.

17:27.960 --> 17:32.240
Ordinary people.

18:11.760 --> 18:13.160
SPECIAL PRICE
FROM 30,000 TO 19,000

18:19.840 --> 18:21.120
Ying.

18:21.800 --> 18:23.600
I want to show you something.

18:24.120 --> 18:25.400
Look at this, Ying.

18:25.960 --> 18:28.120
I'm in the top ten now.

18:28.200 --> 18:29.440
I'm in sixth place.

18:32.720 --> 18:33.720
What?

18:41.920 --> 18:44.680
NUMBER 6, WI PISCHA

18:50.600 --> 18:54.480
This year's Shining Star award goes to

18:55.040 --> 18:59.120
Miss Ying Chenchonnanee Rasameepun.

19:26.640 --> 19:28.400
We are sorry to inform you

19:28.480 --> 19:31.120
that your ranking has dropped

19:31.200 --> 19:33.000
to 21st place.

19:33.800 --> 19:35.240
NUMBER 21, YING CHENCHONNANEE

19:35.320 --> 19:36.280
No.

19:44.400 --> 19:48.080
LERD FAH TOWER

20:20.760 --> 20:22.080
Hello, Ying.

20:22.160 --> 20:23.160
Nanno.

20:24.960 --> 20:26.200
What are you doing here?

20:26.960 --> 20:28.160
Are you buying acne cream?

20:30.440 --> 20:31.400
No.

20:34.800 --> 20:37.600
This shop has so many types of cosmetics.

20:38.120 --> 20:40.960
If we use some,
our ranks will definitely improve.

20:43.280 --> 20:45.000
Can you help me choose?

20:53.160 --> 20:54.720
Ying.

21:13.840 --> 21:18.720
TWO DAYS LATER...

21:23.160 --> 21:24.680
NUMBER 21, YING CHENCHONNANEE

21:24.760 --> 21:25.720
Yes!

21:26.080 --> 21:27.120
My pimple is gone.

21:27.200 --> 21:28.880
Congratulations.

21:28.960 --> 21:31.760
You have climbed the rankings

21:31.840 --> 21:33.400
to tenth place.

21:34.680 --> 21:35.960
What's your first subject?

21:36.040 --> 21:37.800
-I'm not sure. I forgot.
-What?

21:38.640 --> 21:40.960
Jom, Best, hello.

21:41.160 --> 21:42.520
-Hello.
-Hello.

21:42.680 --> 21:43.880
I'll see you in class.

21:46.200 --> 21:47.400
What's with her?

21:47.480 --> 21:49.160
She's acting weird, isn't she?

21:58.160 --> 21:59.800
What are you doing?

22:00.960 --> 22:01.960
New.

22:02.840 --> 22:05.480
I'm a bit dizzy
so I want to go on the swing.

22:06.320 --> 22:07.400
Do you want to join me?

22:10.280 --> 22:12.480
You haven't heard, have you?

22:12.560 --> 22:14.400
You should check your messages.

22:15.160 --> 22:17.240
I'm the one who should be inviting you.

22:17.600 --> 22:19.800
You have no right to use this swing.

22:20.480 --> 22:21.320
Get out of here.

22:25.520 --> 22:26.360
Don't.

22:26.640 --> 22:27.480
Don't.

22:32.920 --> 22:34.480
We are sorry to inform you

22:34.560 --> 22:37.440
that you have dropped down

22:37.520 --> 22:39.080
to 11th place.

22:40.200 --> 22:42.200
NUMBER 11, YING CHENCHONNANEE

22:43.320 --> 22:45.600
LERD FAH TOWER

22:54.320 --> 22:56.560
Please leave this area.

22:57.520 --> 22:59.440
She's with me.

23:05.160 --> 23:07.480
Do you want to join me, Princess 11?

23:11.560 --> 23:12.760
No, thank you.

23:15.040 --> 23:16.560
I'll push you.

23:19.680 --> 23:22.320
Ying, you are so kind.

23:28.520 --> 23:30.000
Thank you, Ying.

23:30.440 --> 23:31.720
I think

23:32.280 --> 23:33.640
it's such a shame.

23:34.000 --> 23:36.240
I want you to be in the top ten with me.

23:38.600 --> 23:39.760
What can I do?

23:40.120 --> 23:41.680
This is probably the best I can do.

23:43.000 --> 23:44.640
Don't give up, Ying.

23:45.880 --> 23:47.800
Actually, there is a way.

23:48.840 --> 23:50.760
If you can't be prettier,

23:52.200 --> 23:54.400
you can make others less pretty.

24:04.600 --> 24:05.760
Wait.

24:07.320 --> 24:08.160
Ying.

24:10.760 --> 24:12.200
You're pushing too hard.

24:19.120 --> 24:20.120
Ying.

24:25.000 --> 24:26.000
Nanno!

24:27.960 --> 24:29.000
Nanno.

24:34.320 --> 24:35.520
Congratulations.

24:35.600 --> 24:39.080
You are now back in the top ten.

24:48.160 --> 24:49.440
Thank you, Nanno.

25:11.160 --> 25:13.520
Let's eat after we do our makeup.

25:13.600 --> 25:15.440
Afternoon tea, like we discussed.

25:15.560 --> 25:16.440
That's right.

25:16.520 --> 25:18.320
Let me fix my face first.

25:18.640 --> 25:20.120
Put on some blush.

25:20.680 --> 25:22.120
Girls.

25:22.520 --> 25:24.680
Have you heard?

25:25.120 --> 25:27.120
-What about?
-Ying.

25:27.200 --> 25:28.960
She's back in the top ten again.

25:29.040 --> 25:31.280
I heard. Everyone heard about it.

25:31.680 --> 25:32.920
Nanno

25:33.320 --> 25:34.480
fell off the swing.

25:34.560 --> 25:37.320
Yes. She fell off the swing.

25:38.000 --> 25:40.440
Every year, as the award day approaches,

25:40.520 --> 25:42.560
things like this start to happen.

25:43.040 --> 25:45.400
Last year, do you remember
what happened to Ann?

25:45.480 --> 25:46.800
-Ann?
-Yes.

25:46.880 --> 25:49.040
The day before the announcement,

25:49.120 --> 25:52.080
she dropped from 2nd to 40th place.

25:52.560 --> 25:54.680
That's right.
She dropped from second place.

25:55.840 --> 25:57.520
She dropped 28 places.

25:58.120 --> 26:00.400
It's 38. What is wrong with your math?

26:00.480 --> 26:02.720
Whatever, 38 places.

26:03.400 --> 26:04.400
That's a lot.

26:05.600 --> 26:08.480
Actually, Gade, I pity Ying.

26:08.560 --> 26:10.680
She's been in tenth place
for five years now.

26:12.200 --> 26:13.840
I feel bad for her.

26:14.280 --> 26:16.080
You can't blame her for it, though.

26:16.440 --> 26:17.640
In Ying's case,

26:17.960 --> 26:19.640
blame it on her mother.

26:22.640 --> 26:23.960
That's harsh.

26:28.120 --> 26:29.280
I'm hungry now.

26:29.360 --> 26:32.200
-Come on. Let's eat.
-Our appointed afternoon tea.

26:32.280 --> 26:33.640
I want some macaroons.

26:34.560 --> 26:35.800
Yes, definitely.

26:35.880 --> 26:37.320
I want some orange juice.

26:37.400 --> 26:38.720
That sounds good.

26:48.120 --> 26:49.400
In Ying's case,

26:49.840 --> 26:51.400
blame it on her mother.

26:51.480 --> 26:53.200
Blame it on her mother.

26:55.360 --> 26:56.800
My mother? As if.

27:34.960 --> 27:36.760
NUMBER 9, YING CHENCHONNANEE

27:39.040 --> 27:41.760
-Why is it so itchy?
-Right?

27:41.840 --> 27:43.000
Why is it so itchy?

27:46.920 --> 27:48.520
NUMBER 7, YING CHENCHONNANEE

27:57.840 --> 27:59.880
You deserve this.

28:02.800 --> 28:04.960
Does something smell strange to you?

28:07.600 --> 28:09.600
Look!

28:09.680 --> 28:10.720
Help!

28:11.320 --> 28:12.600
NUMBER 4, YING CHENCHONNANEE

28:13.520 --> 28:15.320
I see that weird things

28:15.400 --> 28:17.360
are happening to all the girls
in the top ten.

28:17.880 --> 28:20.080
Everyone's ranking has dropped.

28:24.640 --> 28:26.360
-What?
-You look like a monkey.

28:28.520 --> 28:29.400
NUMBER 2, YING CHENCHONNANEE

28:29.480 --> 28:32.040
Stop right now, Cherry. Go to the nurse.

28:32.120 --> 28:33.920
Hello, it's me, Gade.

28:34.000 --> 28:36.880
Today, I will review a new cream.

28:36.960 --> 28:39.640
I've tried it. It really works.

28:40.240 --> 28:41.440
What are you doing?

28:42.480 --> 28:43.560
Nanno.

28:43.640 --> 28:44.600
You scared me.

28:44.680 --> 28:45.960
You've been worn out

28:46.720 --> 28:48.480
these last few days, right?

28:49.160 --> 28:51.440
Since it's so close to the announcement
of the Shining Star,

28:51.520 --> 28:53.840
you should be careful.

28:55.480 --> 28:56.480
Thank you.

29:45.520 --> 29:48.160
LERD FAH TOWER

30:00.040 --> 30:01.120
Do you want a drink?

30:04.400 --> 30:05.760
How did you get in here?

30:06.800 --> 30:07.640
Right now,

30:07.720 --> 30:09.960
our school's beauty standard

30:10.040 --> 30:11.680
has dropped a long way.

30:12.360 --> 30:14.240
Even with my face like this,

30:14.760 --> 30:16.200
I'm in third place.

30:20.320 --> 30:21.880
What happened?

30:22.560 --> 30:23.720
Ying.

30:23.800 --> 30:25.560
You don't have to play dumb.

30:26.200 --> 30:27.200
You

30:27.840 --> 30:29.480
are a role model

30:29.560 --> 30:31.920
for all those wannabe models.

30:32.880 --> 30:34.800
Everyone is copying you.

30:42.480 --> 30:44.640
Are you here to steal my crown
from me, Nanno?

30:47.360 --> 30:49.400
The Shining Star award

30:49.920 --> 30:52.080
is not important to me.

30:53.960 --> 30:55.560
But it is important

30:57.440 --> 30:59.240
to people like you.

31:02.200 --> 31:03.360
People like me?

31:04.960 --> 31:07.400
Are you so sure that you've already won?

31:11.560 --> 31:12.600
That's impossible.

31:13.440 --> 31:14.720
It is possible.

31:16.080 --> 31:17.360
Ying.

31:17.440 --> 31:18.560
Don't forget.

31:19.280 --> 31:21.880
Believe in your beauty

31:22.800 --> 31:24.520
and good luck.

31:29.080 --> 31:31.560
BEAUTY

31:33.120 --> 31:35.520
You should know your place, Ying.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.880
Unfortunately for you, though,

31:37.960 --> 31:39.760
you have your heart set
on the Shining Star.

31:41.680 --> 31:43.360
Do you think that you are the only one

31:43.440 --> 31:45.320
who can be the Shining Star?

31:47.200 --> 31:49.920
Beauty does not last.

31:51.120 --> 31:53.000
And because I know that truth,

31:53.640 --> 31:54.960
I also know

31:55.560 --> 31:58.040
that I can be the Shining Star.

31:58.120 --> 31:59.800
Tenth place like you?

32:04.960 --> 32:06.440
I'll show you.

33:19.040 --> 33:21.880
Hello. Our ranking system

33:21.960 --> 33:24.200
is back online.

33:25.480 --> 33:27.360
Students,

33:27.440 --> 33:29.320
please gather in the main hall

33:29.960 --> 33:33.000
to witness the beauty

33:33.080 --> 33:36.440
in the annual Shining Star award

33:36.520 --> 33:39.880
at Satreevijityatra School.

33:40.520 --> 33:44.200
And to every student,
believe in your beauty.

33:45.840 --> 33:48.920
It looks like everybody is here,

33:49.600 --> 33:55.040
so the announcement of the annual
Shining Star award

33:55.120 --> 33:57.880
will begin now.

34:01.520 --> 34:04.520
In order not to waste anybody's time,

34:05.760 --> 34:09.120
the Shining Star award

34:09.199 --> 34:10.520
goes to...

34:42.760 --> 34:43.880
You can't do this.

34:45.080 --> 34:46.600
Who the hell is she?

34:46.679 --> 34:48.360
She doesn't go to our school.

34:49.639 --> 34:50.840
No matter what,

34:50.920 --> 34:53.480
the award is mine.

34:54.800 --> 34:58.920
Young lady, we must have faith
in our friend's beauty as well.

35:00.160 --> 35:04.320
And the Shining Star Award goes to...

35:12.640 --> 35:14.280
She looks familiar.

35:26.640 --> 35:29.960
Thank... Thank you

35:30.080 --> 35:32.440
to the school...

35:32.520 --> 35:34.520
Shit. It's Chompoo.

35:34.600 --> 35:36.200
...for giving me...

35:36.280 --> 35:37.360
Oh, my god.

35:38.000 --> 35:39.160
...the opportunity.

35:39.920 --> 35:42.760
Thank... Thank you...

35:42.840 --> 35:46.960
to the show Let Me In

35:47.840 --> 35:52.760
for... for making my...

35:53.800 --> 36:00.200
my dream come... come true today.

36:00.280 --> 36:01.280
Thank you.

36:08.160 --> 36:09.960
Don't forget

36:10.040 --> 36:11.640
that beauty is a woman's life,

36:12.200 --> 36:15.800
her faith, and her value.

36:16.840 --> 36:18.800
Let us thank our beauty

36:18.880 --> 36:21.160
for showing us the way.

36:21.760 --> 36:23.800
And to every student,

36:24.520 --> 36:26.640
believe in your beauty.

36:27.440 --> 36:28.840
Good luck.

36:30.560 --> 36:32.200
BEAUTY

36:33.080 --> 36:35.080
Subtitle translation by
Pet-chompoo Sa-ngarmangkang
